Rama waits fasting three nights unanswered by ocean --- Angry Rama rebukes ocean pride to Lakshmana --- Rama declares conciliation wasted on ignoble natures --- Rama vows to block waters with slain sea creatures --- Rama calls for bow and serpent-like arrows --- Rama shines like world-end fire stringing dread bow --- Rama looses blazing thunderbolt arrows into waters --- Ocean surges smoking with shells waves and wind --- Serpents danavas demons reel as mountain waves rise
